</section>

<!-- ===== TESTIMONIALS + CERTIFICATIONS ===== -->
<section class="tmni" id="reviews">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="tm-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Loved by families</span>
      <h2 style="margin:.6rem 0 .8rem">Real minds, real results.</h2>
      <p class="lead" style="margin:0 auto">From students and busy parents to grandparents, Mindtropic has become a daily ritual for clearer, calmer days across the region.</p>
      <div class="tm-agg reveal d1"><span class="starrow lg" data-stars role="img" aria-label="Rated 4.8 out of 5"></span><span class="tm-agg-line"><b>4.8</b> / 5 average · loved by <b>100,000+</b> families across Malaysia, Singapore, Brunei &amp; Indonesia</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="tm-marquee reveal" aria-label="Customer testimonials">
      <div class="tm-row tm-row-l">
        <figure class="tm-card">
          <span class="starrow" data-stars role="img" aria-label="5 out of 5"></span>
          <blockquote class="tm-quote">Three weeks in and the afternoon fog is gone. I get through back-to-back meetings and still have a clear head for my kids at night.</blockquote>
          <figcaption class="tm-who"><span class="tm-av" style="background:linear-gradient(150deg,#7B5FC0,#4B2E8F)">NA</span><span><span class="tm-name">Nurul Aina</span><br><span class="tm-role">Marketing Manager · Kuala Lumpur</span></span></figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="tm-card">
          <span class="starrow" data-stars role="img" aria-label="5 out of 5"></span>
          <blockquote class="tm-quote">I take it before exam week and the difference in recall is real. No jitters, no crash, just steadier focus when I need it.</blockquote>
          <figcaption class="tm-who"><span class="tm-av" style="background:linear-gradient(150deg,#2E84C9,#1C5894)">DT</span><span><span class="tm-name">Daniel Tan</span><br><span class="tm-role">Final-year student · Penang</span></span></figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="tm-card">
          <span class="starrow" data-stars role="img" aria-label="5 out of 5"></span>
          <blockquote class="tm-quote">My son used to drift off during homework. With Mindtropic Junior he settles faster and finishes on his own.</blockquote>
          <figcaption class="tm-who"><span class="tm-av" style="background:linear-gradient(150deg,#37A35C,#1E6E3B)">SR</span><span><span class="tm-name">Siti Rahmah</span><br><span class="tm-role">Mother of two · Shah Alam</span></span></figcaption>
